   <media:title>Must Do Tour In The Whitsundays | A Day Out With Ocean Rafting </media:title>
   <media:content url="https://www.youtube.com/v/9dMbW2u4AUs?version=3" type="application/x-shockwave-flash" width="640" height="390"/>
   <media:thumbnail url="https://i2.ytimg.com/vi/9dMbW2u4AUs/hqdefault.jpg" width="480" height="360"/>
   <media:description>After living in the Whitsundays for almost 3 months, we finally booked a tour out to see Whitehaven beach and hill inlet lookout! After speaking to many locals, they all agreed that oceanrafting was the standout! 

It’s the end of January, in the middle of the wet season and stinger season but that didn’t stop us from having the most epic day!!!

Watch along to see us take on an adventure packed day in the Whitsundays! 

If you enjoy the video or have any other Whitsundays recommendations for us, leave a comment below, like our video and follow our channel to keep up to date with new content! 







#whitsundays #whitehavenbeach #hillinlet #australiasbestbeach #airliebeach #snorkeling #oceanrafting #besttour #mustdoactivitiesinthewhitsundays</media:description>
