   <media:description>If you've ever been to the Dolomites you've seen this mountain range, actually if you've seen a photo of the dolomites chances are its of this mountain. I had dreamed of skiing this ever since I first saw this images. And it's actually nothing that crazy, however conditions meant that I had a tiny window of opportunity to ski this line. A weather system was moving in plus low snow fall meant skiing this might not be a good idea anyway.</media:description>
